WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.880
In 1999, the Akihabara maid cafe industry
was led by two major players:

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:08.130
The Creatureland and Maidalien Groups.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:11.080
The two forces were in a delicate balance.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.670
Despite minor scuffles among bottom-rung cafes,

00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:17.080
the town maintained a façade of peace.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:23.380
But then, Ranko Mannen returns after serving time
for a gang war from fifteen years ago.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.250
She reenters the maid business.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.540
On her very first day,

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.130
Ranko annihilates a maid cafe
belonging to a rival group.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.540
She raids a casino, an underground fight club,

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:35.290
and even a cafe affiliated with the same parent group.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.080
As tensions rise to a breaking point,

00:00:38.420 --> 00:00:40.540
the one behind Maidalien's rise to prominence,

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.210
a maid known as the Crimson Supernova,

00:00:43.210 --> 00:00:44.920
is returning to Akiba.

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.000
It's an honor to have you back.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:06.670
Gotta feel the winds of freedom, ya know?

