Nice okyuuji daiseikyou

00:02:38.250 --> 00:02:40.040
Renai wa no no

00:02:40.040 --> 00:02:42.380
Himitsu no hanazono

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.080
Maidalien

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.080
Extra-Akiba

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:47.080
Terrestrials

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:50.580
Blood in a Sisterly Troth

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:50.580
and the Menace of the Red Bat

00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:50.580
Manami, it's good to have you back.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.500
Who th' hell are you?

00:02:54.710 --> 00:02:56.500
I'm the current head, Ugaki.

00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:59.210
From now on, you work for me.

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:01.710
How goes the Akiba Big Bang?

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.830
It's coming along just fine, of course.

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.290
Ever since I became head,

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:09.380
we've doubled our earnings with the number of cafes
gaining fast on Creatureland.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:13.210
Why's it I see no one from Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam?

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:15.000
They're no longer with us.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:16.420
The hell d'ya mean?

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:20.170
They misbehaved a tad too much and
got crushed by some Creature underlings.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:22.290
It was a shame, really.

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:25.250
But anyway, Manami, put that down and eat up!

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:29.580
Flinging 'round guns and blades and bats
is a thing of the past.

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:36.170
What were y'all doing the seven years
I was eating prison slop, hmm?

00:03:36.170 --> 00:03:37.540
Listen, Manami.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:39.290
I'm the second-generation head.

00:03:39.290 --> 00:03:41.460
You're just one of the senior members.
Remember your pla-

00:03:41.460 --> 00:03:46.290
Don’tcha see havin' these softies here gon' make
Maidalien look like a bunch of wusses?!

00:03:46.290 --> 00:03:47.630
Those days are over, jeez.

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:53.460
You don't give a crap that they talk shit about us,
and you call yerself a fuckin' maid?!

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:00.420
A maid's gotta have credibility.

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:02.830
C-calm down, Manami.

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:04.460
Aren'tcha angry?

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:06.290
Not settlin' a score ain't what we maids do.

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:08.710
Y-yes, of course.
Of course, you're right.

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:11.250
Then why don’t'cha tell me more?

00:04:11.250 --> 00:04:14.080
Which Creature bastards took out
Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam?

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.630
D-doink Oink-oink...

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:17.540
It was Oinky Doink Cafe, Miss Manami.

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:20.540
Oinky Doink Cafe?

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:23.920
Creatureland

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.830
Greetings,

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.830
I hope that the early summer is finding you all well.

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.830
We are writing to announce that

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.830
MANAMI SUPERNOVA YAMAGISHI

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.830
has taken over as acting head of the Maidalien Group.

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.830
We hope for your continued guidance and support

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.830
as we begin this new chapter.

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.830
Sincerely yours,

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:26.830
Kazue Ugaki

00:04:23.930 --> 00:04:26.830
Maidalien Group Head

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:26.880
Manami...

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:31.290
So the Crimson Supernova is back.

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:37.420
Wiping out a sister cafe, and a lucrative one like
Maid Sheep at that, is inexcusable, first of all.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.290
Uh, they were the ones who-

00:04:39.290 --> 00:04:40.500
Second of all,

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:45.040
Maidalien has lodged a complaint with us about
how you crushed Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam.

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:47.040
Um, after all this time?

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:49.250
It doesn't change the fact you did it.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:51.420
But that wasn't really our fault...

00:04:51.420 --> 00:04:53.750
I mean, are pigs really Creatures to begin with?

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:56.080
Pl-please let us still be Creatures!

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:59.040
Creatures are only called as such
when they contribute to the group.

00:04:59.920 --> 00:05:04.290
Go over to Maidalien and settle this matter
of you crushing Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam.

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:05.670
That's what we're saying.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:10.500
But, um, you can't expect a tiny cafe like us
to do anything about a major group like that.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:14.000
If you can't, pigs will go extinct here in Akiba.

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:24.920
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:30.170
DORAMA

00:05:27.750 --> 00:05:30.170
Ramen

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:33.960
Welcome.

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.040
Beer.

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:41.750
Plus soy sauce ramen and a pork cutlet rice bowl.

00:05:43.210 --> 00:05:44.790
You in the same business?

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:45.920
Well, I-

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:47.250
Nah, no need.

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:50.250
I'm jus' here fer the chow today.

00:05:50.670 --> 00:05:51.880
Make it two cups.

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:56.420
Never thought a joint like this'd still be around.

00:05:56.420 --> 00:06:00.290
Young'uns these days just don't get it.
This is the stuff, though.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:05.080
The fact that this ramen still exists
keeps me going here in Akiba.

00:06:05.630 --> 00:06:08.170
Very well said, lady.

00:06:13.540 --> 00:06:14.750
I appreciate it.

00:06:16.630 --> 00:06:20.250
New ain't always the answer t' everything.

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:23.580
Some things best not change, or be changed.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:25.710
Ya know?

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:27.290
Indeed.

00:06:29.670 --> 00:06:30.880
Order's up.

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:37.250
So yeah, they're totally done for.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:38.500
You sure?

00:06:41.210 --> 00:06:43.000
Is something going on here?

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.880
Everyone's on edge.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:50.540
Our group has changed its policies now that
this person called the Crimson Supernova is back.

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:55.460
They say we need to wipe out anything
in the way of the Akiba Big Bang.

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:58.920
We might have to go to war with Creatureland.

00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:00.580
What?

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:03.500
But I want to be better friends with you, Nerula!

00:07:04.630 --> 00:07:05.830
Nagomi...

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.420
I need everyone at Oinky Doink.

00:07:08.040 --> 00:07:09.040
Friend of yours?

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:12.210
Yes! This is Nerula from Invader Cafe Destron!

00:07:12.210 --> 00:07:13.790
It's very nice to meet you.

00:07:15.250 --> 00:07:17.040
I'm the manager at Oinky Doink.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:18.250
Nice to meet ya!

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.540
The pleasure's all mine.

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:21.880
Nagomi, let's go.

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:23.080
Oh, uh right.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.080
See you!

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:28.750
So yeah, it's now our job
to do something about Maidalien.

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:30.080
"Something"?

00:07:30.380 --> 00:07:32.960
To put it bluntly, it means we're supposed to go die.

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:36.380
You mean Creatureland's abandoning us?

00:07:36.380 --> 00:07:37.630
For real?

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.040
Let's take the five million yen from Sheep and run for it.

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:42.670
You really think there's anywhere we can run to?

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:45.630
Then how 'bout we take that money
to Maidalien and say sorry?

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:47.790
Like five million's enough.

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:51.330
They're a major group on par with
the Creatureland Group.

00:07:52.210 --> 00:07:53.920
Then we'll take out their leader.

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:55.250
An assassination.

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:56.420
That's practical.

00:07:56.420 --> 00:07:58.000
The head of the group?

00:07:58.000 --> 00:07:59.460
Won't she be heavily guarded?

00:07:59.460 --> 00:08:02.750
I mean like, who's the head of Maidalien, anyway?

00:08:03.080 --> 00:08:04.830
The Crimson Supernova.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:06.290
Say what?

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:08.420
Apparently someone called that is back.

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:12.000
If we all go apologize really hard,
I'm sure they'll forgive us!

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.830
That kind of thinking won't fly in this business.

00:08:14.830 --> 00:08:16.250
You should realize that by now.

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:18.580
I know that, but...

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:19.790
Yeah, yeah!

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:22.000
You still don't like violence, right?

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:27.420
But hey, someone might die trying to protect you
if you can't fight, hear me?

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:33.130
Oinky Doink Cafe

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:31.130
Yes, that's right.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:33.130
I'd like info on the head of Maidalien.

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:35.630
Uh no, hold on!

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.710
Oh jeez, they hung up, damn it!
You could just tell me!

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:44.540
Nagomi, what's up?

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.670
Do you think we really have to fight?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:51.500
I really don't want to have to fight a friend.

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:53.080
Friend?

00:08:53.540 --> 00:08:54.790
Oh, you mean her.

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:57.830
Sure, I get it.
Of course you don't want to fight.

00:08:58.210 --> 00:08:59.710
I don't know what to do.

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:02.580
What if you two become sisters?

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:05.920
"Sisters"? Like an oath of sisterhood?

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:06.920
Yeah, yeah.

00:09:06.920 --> 00:09:09.880
You swear the oath with another maid
and exchange name tags.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:13.000
But Nerula belongs to the Maidalien Group.

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.790
Of course you can't hope for our head's blessing,

00:09:16.790 --> 00:09:20.710
but you know that the bond of sisterhood
is super important to a maid, right?

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:22.540
The bond of sisterhood?

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:25.580
Here in this cafe, I'm your parent, Nagomi.

00:09:25.580 --> 00:09:27.540
I'd be happy to act as a witness or whatever.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:30.290
Do you think Nerula will agree to it?

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:32.750
Sure she will!
She's your friend, isn't she?

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:36.290
Nagomi...

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:41.500
I worry that making an oath of sisterhood with
a maid from another group may be risky.

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:46.540
Speaking from experience,

00:09:46.540 --> 00:09:49.330
an oath of sisterhood isn't a definite thing.

00:09:50.330 --> 00:09:52.380
You had a sister, Ranko?

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:54.040
Yes, long ago.

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:56.540
A fellow maid in the cafe I worked at.

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.170
She was very capable.

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.130
I thought we were sisters, Ranko!

00:10:01.130 --> 00:10:02.420
Why are you against this?!

00:10:02.420 --> 00:10:06.420
You know that Miss Michiyo decided on
a nonaggressive defense policy.

00:10:06.420 --> 00:10:09.330
Going out on the offensive would
go against her wishes.

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:12.330
Protecting this cafe serves to protect Miss Michiyo!

00:10:12.330 --> 00:10:14.500
For that, we've gotta fight!

00:10:14.500 --> 00:10:15.710
I have to disagree.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:18.790
RANKO

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:24.540
I have no idea where she is now.

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:27.830
Are you against this, Ranko?

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:31.080
Oinky Doink Cafe is at odds with Maidalien.

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:35.460
We can't rule out the possibility
of Nerula turning on you or something.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:39.880
Still, I want to stick by Nerula's side.

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:46.290
Nagomi? What's going on?!

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:50.580
Um, well, uh...

00:10:51.080 --> 00:10:53.830
I want you to join me in an oath of sisterhood!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:55.670
Please!

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.670
But Nagomi...

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.040
You and I belong to different groups.

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:02.040
I know that! Still!

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:05.880
You're serious?

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:07.790
This is my show of resolve.

00:11:07.790 --> 00:11:10.960
I want to become sisters with you
and stay friends forever!

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:21.000
I guess I'm going to be a big sister.

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:24.460
I'll do it.
Let's be sisters, Nagomi.

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:26.210
I'm so glad!

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:28.500
I thought you might say no!

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:32.710
No matter what the higher-ups might say,
I'm going to dream big and go go.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:34.830
DORAMA

00:11:37.130 --> 00:11:38.670
Let us partake.

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:57.250
We have partaken.

00:11:57.250 --> 00:11:59.170
Congratulations.

00:11:59.170 --> 00:12:03.580
May your bond of sisterhood be
everlasting and joyous.

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:06.750
Please ready your hands.

00:12:07.250 --> 00:12:08.630
Yooooo!

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:11.750
NAGOMI

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:13.170
NERULA

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:17.460
Don't let the noodles get limp.

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:18.460
Right!

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:22.130
Wow, Pops, you're really used to conducting this, huh?

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:23.540
Did it a long time ago.

00:12:23.670 --> 00:12:25.630
Nagomi, you should have the pork.

00:12:27.170 --> 00:12:28.960
Then you take the egg, Nerula.

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:34.630
Maidalien

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:35.670
We gon' go crush the pigsty they call Oinky Doink.

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:37.790
Y'all go wild to yer heart's content.

00:12:38.670 --> 00:12:41.830
What? If ya wanna say something, spit it out.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:44.540
Things have changed since you were here.

00:12:44.540 --> 00:12:46.250
Why'd we hafta do things any different?

00:12:46.250 --> 00:12:48.670
Us and the Creatures,
we've kept a respectful distance.

00:12:48.670 --> 00:12:52.460
Y'all are mighty cocky when it comes
to bitchin' and moaning, eh?

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:53.830
So what?

00:12:53.830 --> 00:12:58.130
Ya think th' kind of sissy extraterrestrials who
stand by and let Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam get crushed

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:00.540
can make the Akiba Big Bang happen?

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:03.460
I mean, what's this Akiba Big Bang, anyway?

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:11.830
This is the Akiba Big Bang!

00:13:11.830 --> 00:13:14.880
How could you be in Maidalien and not know that?!

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:16.080
Listen up.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:19.330
Maidalien maids are Extra-Akiba Terrestrial invaders!

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:22.710
Any wussy maids get sunk in the
Sea of Tranquility, y'hear?

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:30.500
After we exterminate the swine, it'll be yer cafes next
with brain implants fer the lot of ya.

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:32.790
NERULA

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:41.670
Now that you've made an oath of sisterhood,
she's your sister, right?

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.500
That means she's basically like
a daughter to me, y'know?

00:13:44.500 --> 00:13:46.540
Let's have her come over for a visit sometime.

00:13:46.540 --> 00:13:48.250
Wouldn't that be dangerous right now?

00:13:48.250 --> 00:13:50.830
Just a casual visit!

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:53.170
I'd love to have a nice long chat with her!

00:13:53.170 --> 00:13:57.080
Like about Nerula's cafe, and about Maidalien...

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:58.080
Chief?

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:01.130
Exploiting a bond of sisterhood?
You've gotta be kidding.

00:14:01.130 --> 00:14:02.920
But we really don't have a choice, y'know?

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:05.330
I don't get what's going on at all.

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:06.710
A spy, she means.

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:10.750
I would really love to get info on the
head of Maidalien and stuff.

00:14:10.750 --> 00:14:14.250
'Cuz hey, us and Maidalien,
we're like sardines up against a sperm whale,

00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:16.210
so getting info is key, right?

00:14:16.960 --> 00:14:18.290
You're despicable.

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:20.290
What kind of person does that?!

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:23.000
Don't you know we're all gonna get killed at this rate?!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:25.830
I'm like a parent to you, remember?

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:27.920
C'mon, show your mommy some love.

00:14:28.170 --> 00:14:30.920
True, it may be our only viable prospect.

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:32.880
Given the situation, yeah.

00:14:32.880 --> 00:14:34.330
A spy is our only hope.

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:36.960
Nagomi, I'm begging you!

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.170
I don't think so!

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:41.630
This is a test of your dignity as a maid!

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:45.460
Each and every one of you must do what you should
as members of Maidalien!

00:14:41.880 --> 00:14:53.790
Invader Cafe Destron

00:14:45.790 --> 00:14:49.000
Wuv-Wuv Moonbeam was ravaged by the Creatures.

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.670
Terminate the pigs responsible!

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:53.830
We will prove the Extra-Akiba Terrestrials'
superior cultural prowess to the world

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:57.130
and use this opportunity to exterminate
all Creatures from Akiba!

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.920
Space war is imminent!

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:11.040
This month, we have a star fruit fair going on.

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:13.080
Oh, th-that sounds yummy!

00:15:13.080 --> 00:15:15.380
We're having a Top Shop Pork Chop event.

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:17.460
Sounds lovely.

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:21.790
Um hey, do you want to come visit our cafe some-

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.170
Oh dear!

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:24.330
Are you okay?

00:15:24.330 --> 00:15:26.630
Sorry, yes, I'm fine.

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:28.460
Here.

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:32.710
Thank you for your help.

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.170
Maidalien plans to

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.170
storm Oinky Doink.

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.170
End goal is to annihilate

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.170
Creatureland Group.

00:15:44.540 --> 00:15:47.130
You mean they're actually after us?

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:50.580
Planning to crush us to trigger an all-out war, huh?

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:52.380
This is valuable info.

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:54.880
If not for this, we would have been sitting ducks.

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:56.920
For real though, this is great.

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:58.380
We should thank the spy.

00:15:58.500 --> 00:16:01.080
Nagomi! Thank you, dutiful daughter!

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:02.710
I didn't do anything!

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:04.670
Anyway, let's get ready!

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.040
Miss Manami! There's a copper here.

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:12.880
Extra-Akiba

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:12.880
Terrestrials

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:14.290
Well see, I heard you got a new acting head

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:16.130
Maidalien

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:16.130
Extra-Akiba

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:16.130
Terrestrials

00:16:14.290 --> 00:16:16.130
so I figured I should say hello.

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:17.580
Oh, by the way.

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:20.960
I hear you're going to have a romp with
Creatureland sometime soon?

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:24.080
I don't think I know what'cha mean.

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:26.420
Well, we got tipped off, you see.

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:31.500
It's just we police have to investigate or
we meet the wrath of the citizens.

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:35.630
But really, it looks like Maidalien's
doing rather well, aren't you?

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:38.830
Officer, I just came got back t' this town

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:41.880
and can't tell the Showa-dori exit
from the Electric Town exit.

00:16:42.380 --> 00:16:45.790
I do hope we can rely on you fer guidance.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:03.500
That's good money down the drain!
Where'd that leak from?!

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.830
Go find the goddamn rat squealin' on us!

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:07.080
Right!

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:11.130
By the way, apparently the police were at
Maidalien headquarters the other day.

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:12.790
Wait, does that mean we're safe?

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:14.380
We shouldn't let our guard down.

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:16.670
We should be on alert for a while.

00:17:17.330 --> 00:17:19.330
Don't ever go anywhere alone.

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:23.710
I haven't been able to reach Nerula
since she handed me that note.

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:27.130
I-I'm sure she's fine!
She's a tough kid!

00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:29.250
I can tell that about people, okay?

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:33.000
Nagomi, do you wish to search for Nerula?

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:35.380
I want to do what I can.

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:38.580
Then I shall accompany you
on your strolls starting tomorrow.

00:17:39.130 --> 00:17:42.880
Oinky Doink is being targeted right now,
so we need to be on our guard.

00:17:43.960 --> 00:17:45.130
Right...

00:17:47.630 --> 00:17:49.750
Pretty certain this is the one.

00:17:52.330 --> 00:17:53.790
Gotta erase her then.

00:17:54.040 --> 00:17:55.460
We're tracking her down already.

00:18:00.250 --> 00:18:03.040
No sign of Nerula today, either...

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:05.500
Have you been sleeping at all recently?

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:07.250
No, I'm too worried.

00:18:07.630 --> 00:18:08.830
She's alive.

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:10.790
The kid's alive.

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:12.710
You've seen Nerula?

00:18:12.710 --> 00:18:13.710
Yep.

00:18:14.170 --> 00:18:15.670
Where was that?!

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:27.580
Nerula!

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.790
Nagomi? Why?!

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.710
I'm so glad you're okay!

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:37.170
I'm sorry I worried you.

00:18:39.130 --> 00:18:40.960
They're looking for me.

00:18:41.290 --> 00:18:43.210
Because I betrayed Maidalien.

00:18:43.790 --> 00:18:45.080
Because of me?

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:48.080
No, I wanted to.

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:51.460
I'm glad I got to see you one last time.

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:52.790
Last time?

00:18:53.000 --> 00:18:55.920
I'm going to stick by my own maid principles.

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:59.080
What 'ave we here?

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:01.790
What'cha doing, conspirin' with swine?

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:06.130
Just making small talk.

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:09.880
D'ya know what you've gone and done,

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:12.630
gettin' in the way of us crushing th' pigs?

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:15.130
I'll take responsibility for my actions.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.670
Nagomi, we should go.

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:18.040
What do you mean, responsibility?

00:19:18.040 --> 00:19:20.290
This is Maidalien's business to sort out.

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:24.210
You're the one I met a' the ramen joint.

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:27.380
That's too bad.
And here I thought we hit it off.

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:29.250
I agree, it's a shame.

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:31.540
S'pose it was meant to be, though.

00:19:31.790 --> 00:19:34.630
I'll crush ya along with th' rest of Creatureland.

00:19:41.210 --> 00:19:42.420
Why you!

00:19:42.420 --> 00:19:45.380
You know who yer pointin' that blade at?

00:19:45.380 --> 00:19:47.000
Crimson Supernova...

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:49.130
prepare to die!

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.920
Aw, this better be worth it.

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:58.040
Miyabi! Don’t you butt in!

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:03.540
Take that!

00:20:04.920 --> 00:20:07.130
Better loosen that grip there.

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:12.790
Nerula!

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:14.000
Stay back!

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:21.080
You die here.

00:20:22.250 --> 00:20:24.460
Pesky little prick...

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:26.880
Ranko, you've got to help her!

00:20:26.880 --> 00:20:28.580
This is their issue.

00:20:28.580 --> 00:20:30.580
But if we don't, Nerula will...

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:32.540
That is what it means to be an Akiba maid.

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:34.580
Nerula knew what she was getting into.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:36.500
Who cares about all that?!

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.750
Nerula is my sister!

00:20:39.790 --> 00:20:42.130
Those words are all I need.

00:20:50.080 --> 00:20:54.080
Traitors only have one place t' go, and that's Hell.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:20:59.000
Don't you dare!
Nagomi!

00:21:09.130 --> 00:21:10.380
Nerula!

00:21:11.460 --> 00:21:12.670
Nerula!

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.250
No...

00:21:15.420 --> 00:21:16.830
No way! Please no!

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:20.250
Harming one of ours now
goes against the code, does it not?

00:21:23.330 --> 00:21:24.540
Put it down.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:27.250
All ya do is cry without doing shit.

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:29.420
And ya call yerself a maid?

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:32.920
Miss Manami, coppers.

00:21:34.170 --> 00:21:36.040
No more today.

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:40.290
Don't forget, our war's just gettin' started.

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:45.210
What do I do?!
The blood won't stop!

00:21:45.630 --> 00:21:46.830
Nagomi...

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:52.540
I'm sorry, I dragged you into this...

00:21:52.540 --> 00:21:55.880
No, you're wrong!
It was me!

00:21:56.710 --> 00:21:58.920
NAGOMI

00:21:57.540 --> 00:21:58.920
I wish...

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:02.420
I could have lived a bit longer...

00:22:08.830 --> 00:22:12.880
Don't change the way you are...

00:22:16.290 --> 00:22:19.500
Be the maid you are now...

00:22:19.790 --> 00:22:23.830
NAGOMI

00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:23.080
Noooooo!

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:28.290
When you don't know the meaining of love
Ai no imi nado shiranakerya

00:22:29.960 --> 00:22:35.380
There's nothing to be afraid of
Kowai mono nado naidaroga

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:40.920
Fate brought us together somehow
Nanno inga ka meguri au

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:50.630
Swine of a leather flock together
Nitamono doushi no butadomo ni

00:22:51.000 --> 00:22:57.080
Is the shiny drop streaking down the cheek
Hoho o tsutau kirameki wa

00:22:57.080 --> 00:23:05.170
The warmth of a humane soul
Hito no kokoro no nukumori ka

00:23:06.040 --> 00:23:12.420
Revenging every wrong done to me
Yararetara yarikaesu

00:23:12.750 --> 00:23:18.330
But what lies after that
Sono saki ni naniga aruka

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:25.040
I don't know, so I've been searching to see
Wakarazu ni sagashiteta

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:31.040
Who I am
Jibun ga dare nanoka

00:23:31.040 --> 00:23:37.920
Show me through the pain
Itami de oshietokure
